    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaed724bc159bb70d78d422b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“视点”有着切实的差距。\r\n从宇宙之上进行观测的话，\r\n这一天不过只是又一次平平无奇的自转而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2762e226bcdaf23fc3c503749834fd614598b4f6b2d0e3a88f7438d2ef47bd19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
