      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本应该是单相思关系的二人，\r\n开始共同耕作。\r\n这原因，大概是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bebefe1b7aa86f86d02838b9c5eb668c38a417919fb52e2d40ef7a16acb8b9bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
