    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073228a6dc1805a78f1a2cae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于，“技术”开始革新……\r\n新宇宙与你的“合作”也停止了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6313a6846db382dddc906e92b8221e7e5d9d24e8163104bf63527e75ccdb5fed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
