    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76fd758402ac18045f1538b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是『耕作』还是『战斗』，都停止了。\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2422c92b3468aa8352eb058c1e2b8c88f939ccbb9de6fdfb8a1439cc95c9d17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
