    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f7cf456f56a0638fd18bc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但即便如此……新宇宙与你仍陪在彼此身边。\r\n作为……“ZEER”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82b858ac27a32d38c0d887dd83c15dec04b15492d09cce2a25240b4bcbf0fc2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
