      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb140b3cde9633fce13d57a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你说的是……这个宇宙的事情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0ca9897dd6c45835019e9bb62b04dea556ba4545f9632bf36fa46558374617",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6756a861cf6fdf3826f0e8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这实在是一段堪称壮丽雄伟的故事。\r\n但此时，我才注意到一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "651d9d0cd060b70b942222e1183c933ebeafe67e5458a5aadd651d3044664ee3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
