    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35047657e7fc1059a11140b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——这就是“退相干”呢。\r\n（退相干：量子力学名词，一个系统在与环境的\r\n相互作用中逐渐丢失相干性的过程。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfd03762e6a71fef9134a8bc0aa83ab61572e2e65867b5ad3aa5541c4553dd8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
