    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5ed0a227e36f32ae396380",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来……无论哪个宇宙，这份情谊都仍延续着。\r\n无论是我与新宇宙……还是人类与赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ba13277dc2cd7eb1b31e12ccbb1ca70477dab6440e685ff0937a02c7b2ec9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
