    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58891a181f80d01ae8b422a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为乘上了这“潮流”，\r\n新宇宙和你——\r\n能够共度这圣诞节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb892bf4619d905b37227fb3e1017b26c96a140ce50291e063e23cf80abd84b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13bfa59b3d0860daac8b5345",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我逐渐感受到新宇宙那高昂而崇高的心情。\r\n正是因为有了这悠久历史的不断积累——\r\n才终于有了现在的我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0c6f54f4c2128213fd83a4e7fb7a9470ed9c505660f6bd52b55c93fe4b51d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:211a042104e5481203c54172",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来，新宇宙啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46cccb6e30b583f4a015cea7f8e3f6c8b2cbbb8bd86296202b779898738a80cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5295c37dc4be18109c07af5",
      "kind": "story",
